    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Wraps an iterator of pairs to be an iterator of opposite pairs, so that if *it == (a, b) then *OppositePairIterator(it) == (b, a). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
